# Build context filter. Only the built SPA and the serving config are needed;
# excluding node_modules/src also keeps the CDK asset hash stable across installs.
# Dockerfile must stay listed: CDK stages this directory using these rules and
# then runs `docker build` in the staged copy, so an excluded Dockerfile breaks
# the asset build (unlike a plain `docker build`, which always sends it).
*
!Dockerfile
!dist/
!nginx/
!docker-entrypoint.sh
